# Amey's Arc | Repository Attributes & Line Normalization
# Standardized for Scholarly Archiving and Technical Integrity

# Handle line endings automatically for all files detected as text.
# Enforce LF for consistent cross-platform scholarly record keeping.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly mark text files with diff handling and normalization.
*.md text eol=lf diff=markdown linguist-documentation
*.html text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
.gitignore text eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf

# Mark binary files to prevent corruption and optimize repository storage.
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.mp4 binary
*.pptx binary
*.docx binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary

# Repository Classification
*.md linguist-documentation
LICENSE* linguist-documentation
SECURITY.md linguist-documentation